<title>AUSTRIA: Flughafen Wien 1996 EPS down at 29 ATS.</title>
<headline>Flughafen Wien 1996 EPS down at 29 ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vienna airport operator Flughafen Wien's 1996 earnings per share fell to 29 schillings from 33 schillings a year ago, the Association of Austrian analysts said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company is due to release its full set of 1996 earnings on Thursday.</p>
<p>Flughafen shares closed 9.50 schillings higher at 518.50 on strong volume of 53,300 lots in Vienna trading. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
